<!DOCTYPE template>
<Template>
  <WidgetGroup>
    <Layout>vertical</Layout>
    <SizePolicy>me,f</SizePolicy>
    <Children>
      <WidgetGroup>
        <Layout>horizontal</Layout>
        <Children>
          <Label>
            <Text>MASHUP LIVE</Text>
            <Size>110f,28f</Size>
          </Label>
          <PushButton>
            <ObjectName>GameflorrStem</ObjectName>
            <Size>148f,28f</Size>
            <NumberStates>2</NumberStates>
            <LeftClickIsPushButton>true</LeftClickIsPushButton>
            <Tooltip>Deux pistes préparées en lecture et synchronisées. Le DJ garde les départs et le crossfader.</Tooltip>
            <State>
              <Number>0</Number>
              <Text>Voix A + instru B</Text>
            </State>
            <State>
              <Number>1</Number>
              <Text>Voix A + instru B</Text>
            </State>
            <Connection>
              <ConfigKey>[Gameflorr],live_mashup_a</ConfigKey>
              <ConnectValueToWidget>false</ConnectValueToWidget>
              <EmitOnPressAndRelease>true</EmitOnPressAndRelease>
            </Connection>
            <Connection>
              <ConfigKey>[Gameflorr],live_mashup_mode</ConfigKey>
              <Transform>
                <IsEqual>1</IsEqual>
              </Transform>
              <ConnectValueFromWidget>false</ConnectValueFromWidget>
            </Connection>
          </PushButton>
          <PushButton>
            <ObjectName>GameflorrStem</ObjectName>
            <Size>148f,28f</Size>
            <NumberStates>2</NumberStates>
            <LeftClickIsPushButton>true</LeftClickIsPushButton>
            <Tooltip>Deux pistes préparées en lecture et synchronisées. Le DJ garde les départs et le crossfader.</Tooltip>
            <State>
              <Number>0</Number>
              <Text>Voix B + instru A</Text>
            </State>
            <State>
              <Number>1</Number>
              <Text>Voix B + instru A</Text>
            </State>
            <Connection>
              <ConfigKey>[Gameflorr],live_mashup_b</ConfigKey>
              <ConnectValueToWidget>false</ConnectValueToWidget>
              <EmitOnPressAndRelease>true</EmitOnPressAndRelease>
            </Connection>
            <Connection>
              <ConfigKey>[Gameflorr],live_mashup_mode</ConfigKey>
              <Transform>
                <IsEqual>2</IsEqual>
              </Transform>
              <ConnectValueFromWidget>false</ConnectValueFromWidget>
            </Connection>
          </PushButton>
          <PushButton>
            <ObjectName>GameflorrStem</ObjectName>
            <Size>148f,28f</Size>
            <NumberStates>2</NumberStates>
            <LeftClickIsPushButton>true</LeftClickIsPushButton>
            <Tooltip>Deux pistes préparées en lecture et synchronisées. Le DJ garde les départs et le crossfader.</Tooltip>
            <State>
              <Number>0</Number>
              <Text>Passer la voix</Text>
            </State>
            <State>
              <Number>1</Number>
              <Text>Passer la voix</Text>
            </State>
            <Connection>
              <ConfigKey>[Gameflorr],live_mashup_swap</ConfigKey>
              <ConnectValueToWidget>false</ConnectValueToWidget>
              <EmitOnPressAndRelease>true</EmitOnPressAndRelease>
            </Connection>
          </PushButton>
          <PushButton>
            <ObjectName>GameflorrStem</ObjectName>
            <Size>148f,28f</Size>
            <NumberStates>2</NumberStates>
            <LeftClickIsPushButton>true</LeftClickIsPushButton>
            <Tooltip>Deux pistes préparées en lecture et synchronisées. Le DJ garde les départs et le crossfader.</Tooltip>
            <State>
              <Number>0</Number>
              <Text>Mix complet</Text>
            </State>
            <State>
              <Number>1</Number>
              <Text>Mix complet</Text>
            </State>
            <Connection>
              <ConfigKey>[Gameflorr],live_mashup_reset</ConfigKey>
              <ConnectValueToWidget>false</ConnectValueToWidget>
              <EmitOnPressAndRelease>true</EmitOnPressAndRelease>
            </Connection>
            <Connection>
              <ConfigKey>[Gameflorr],live_mashup_mode</ConfigKey>
              <Transform>
                <IsEqual>0</IsEqual>
              </Transform>
              <ConnectValueFromWidget>false</ConnectValueFromWidget>
            </Connection>
          </PushButton>
          <Label>
            <Text>A = platine 1 · B = platine 2 · volumes / crossfader manuels</Text>
            <Size>0me,28f</Size>
          </Label>
        </Children>
      </WidgetGroup>
      <Label>
        <Text>Prêt · démarrez sur les phrases choisies et réglez les volumes / le crossfader.</Text>
        <Size>0me,20f</Size>
        <Connection>
          <ConfigKey>[Gameflorr],live_mashup_status</ConfigKey>
          <BindProperty>visible</BindProperty>
          <Transform>
            <IsEqual>0</IsEqual>
          </Transform>
        </Connection>
      </Label>
      <Label>
        <Text>Reprenez la main sur AutoDJ avant le mashup live.</Text>
        <Size>0me,20f</Size>
        <Connection>
          <ConfigKey>[Gameflorr],live_mashup_status</ConfigKey>
          <BindProperty>visible</BindProperty>
          <Transform>
            <IsEqual>1</IsEqual>
          </Transform>
        </Connection>
      </Label>
      <Label>
        <Text>Chargez deux titres avec les 4 stems préparés sur A et B.</Text>
        <Size>0me,20f</Size>
        <Connection>
          <ConfigKey>[Gameflorr],live_mashup_status</ConfigKey>
          <BindProperty>visible</BindProperty>
          <Transform>
            <IsEqual>2</IsEqual>
          </Transform>
        </Connection>
      </Label>
      <Label>
        <Text>Démarrez les deux platines et désactivez le passthrough.</Text>
        <Size>0me,20f</Size>
        <Connection>
          <ConfigKey>[Gameflorr],live_mashup_status</ConfigKey>
          <BindProperty>visible</BindProperty>
          <Transform>
            <IsEqual>3</IsEqual>
          </Transform>
        </Connection>
      </Label>
      <Label>
        <Text>Grilles stables, même tonalité et verrouillage de tonalité requis.</Text>
        <Size>0me,20f</Size>
        <Connection>
          <ConfigKey>[Gameflorr],live_mashup_status</ConfigKey>
          <BindProperty>visible</BindProperty>
          <Transform>
            <IsEqual>4</IsEqual>
          </Transform>
        </Connection>
      </Label>
      <Label>
        <Text>Synchronisez les tempos de A et B (écart maximal 0,5 %).</Text>
        <Size>0me,20f</Size>
        <Connection>
          <ConfigKey>[Gameflorr],live_mashup_status</ConfigKey>
          <BindProperty>visible</BindProperty>
          <Transform>
            <IsEqual>5</IsEqual>
          </Transform>
        </Connection>
      </Label>
      <Label>
        <Text>Rétablissez les stems sans mute, avec des gains entre 0 et 1.</Text>
        <Size>0me,20f</Size>
        <Connection>
          <ConfigKey>[Gameflorr],live_mashup_status</ConfigKey>
          <BindProperty>visible</BindProperty>
          <Transform>
            <IsEqual>6</IsEqual>
          </Transform>
        </Connection>
      </Label>
      <Label>
        <Text>Retour progressif au mix complet…</Text>
        <Size>0me,20f</Size>
        <Connection>
          <ConfigKey>[Gameflorr],live_mashup_status</ConfigKey>
          <BindProperty>visible</BindProperty>
          <Transform>
            <IsEqual>7</IsEqual>
          </Transform>
        </Connection>
      </Label>
    </Children>
    <Connection>
      <ConfigKey>[Skin],show_stem_controls</ConfigKey>
      <BindProperty>visible</BindProperty>
    </Connection>
  </WidgetGroup>
</Template>
